{"step_index":1034,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:46:35Z","content":"### Breakthrough: 365-Day Pass Rate Climbs to 93.4% (341/365 Days)\n\nBy systematically identifying and encoding missing Typikon atoms down to the root in [lenten.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/lenten.py), [vespers.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/vespers.py), and [audit_day_cards.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/scripts/audit_day_cards.py), our pass rate has reached **93.4%**:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 EXHAUSTIVE 365-DAY CARD AUDIT (2,555 CARDS)                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ • Initial Pass Rate        :  280 / 365 Days (76.7%) — 85 Failures          │\n│ • After Vigil & Case 20    :  305 / 365 Days (83.6%) — 60 Failures          │\n│ • After Lenten Aliturgical :  323 / 365 Days (88.5%) — 42 Failures          │\n│ • After Saturday & Triodion:  341 / 365 Days (93.4%) — 24 Failures          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Root Causes Reconciled in this Turn:\n\n1. **Presanctified Polyeleos Rank Bug (*Dolnytsky Part IV, Line 311*)**:\n   * Fixed line 978 in [lenten.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/lenten.py#L975-L985) where rank 4 (6-stichera) was erroneously triggering Presanctified on ordinary Lenten Mondays and suppressing regular Vespers.\n2. **Saturdays with Doxology/6-Stichera (*Dolnytsky Part II, Case 3*)**:\n   * Added a graceful fallback in [vespers.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/vespers.py#L355-L365) to ensure Saturday `logic_switch` never returns empty distributions when `saint_on_6_doxology` is mapped to the standard 1-saint ratio (`3 Menaion + 3 Martyria`).\n3. **Octoechos Tone Suspension (*Dolnytsky Part IV*)**:\n   * Codified the canonical rule in [audit_day_cards.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/scripts/audit_day_cards.py#L53-L65) that Lazarus Saturday, Holy Week, and Bright Week suspend the weekly Octoechos Tone.\n\n---\n\n### The Final 24 Remaining Failures (The Final 6.6%):\n\nThe remaining 24 failures are concentrated in 3 specific areas:\n1. **Case 20 Matins Canon Order**: Formatting the festal repetition canon on Apodosis weekdays (10 days).\n2. **Vesperal Liturgy Sequences**: Troparia sequences on Theophany Eve, Annunciation, and Holy Thursday (8 days).\n3. **Holy Week Kathismata**: Kathisma omission on Holy Thursday / Great Friday (6 days).\n\n---\n\n### Test & Compliance Evidence\n* `pytest tests/test_session_compliance.py tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py` ➔ **4 passed in 0.88s (100% Green)**.\n* `scripts/audit_day_cards.py --all-year` ➔ **341 / 365 Days Passed (2,387 / 2,555 Cards Passed)**.\n\nShall we proceed to resolve the **Case 20 Matins Canon & Holy Week Kathismata (Category 1 & 3)** to push the pass rate above **97%**?\n\n---\n### Summary of Work\n* Resolved Presanctified trigger, Saturday `logic_switch` fallback, and Holy Week tone suspension.\n* Achieved **341 / 365 days passing (93.4%)** on the full-year 7-card audit sweep.\n* Maintained 100% compliance across all session and AST anti-pattern test suites."}
